        summary: "A short trail to a graveyard with far more to salvage than usual.",
        reward: Salvage,
        length: (1, 2),
        target: "deep_graveyard",
        sources: ["hauler_log", "distress_call"],
        hint: "A graveyard",
    ),
    // The deeper bands' caches and graveyards (GDR-0128, lead defaults 20 Oct 2026): spare trails of their bands (after
    // the lore), each band's cache paying more research data and programmable matter than the last, and a material of
    // the band's race; the inner band's in the cluster types of the race that keeps them (one race per cluster).
    (
        id: "overgrown_cache",
        name: "An overgrown cache",
        summary: "A sealed precursor cache in the outer reach, overgrown by the Grown: research data and programmable matter, straight into store.",
